RectaBot — Third-party attributions and acknowledgments
========================================================

This file documents third-party components, fonts, references, and tools
used in the RectaBot project, along with their respective licenses.


## Third-party components

### grblHAL
- Upstream: https://github.com/grblHAL
- License: GPL-3.0
- Used by: RectaBot-firmware (separate repository)
- The RectaBot firmware is a fork of grblHAL with a board map for the RP2350B.
  All firmware modifications inherit the GPL-3.0 license from upstream.

### Raspberry Pi Pico SDK
- Upstream: https://github.com/raspberrypi/pico-sdk
- License: BSD-3-Clause
- Used by: RectaPad pendant firmware (separate repository)
- Provides hardware abstraction for the RP2350B microcontroller.

### LVGL (Light and Versatile Graphics Library)
- Upstream: https://github.com/lvgl/lvgl
- License: MIT
- Used by: RectaPad pendant firmware (separate repository)
- Provides the touch GUI framework on the pendant.

### WIZnet ioLibrary
- Upstream: https://github.com/Wiznet/ioLibrary_Driver
- License: BSD-3-Clause
- Used by: RectaBot-firmware (Ethernet driver for W5500)

### Tailwind CSS (loaded via CDN)
- Upstream: https://tailwindcss.com
- License: MIT
- Used by: Web configurator in `Docs/configurator/`


