## Hardware reference designs

The following reference designs influenced the RectaBot v1.0 hardware
and are credited here for transparency:

- Raspberry Pi Foundation RP2350 reference design (TPS5430 buck topology,
  USB-C device mode)
- WIZnet W5500 reference application notes (Bob Smith termination,
  magnetics integration)
- Bart Dring (Buildlog) — pioneer grblHAL board designer; inspiration
  for input isolation topology
- Phil Barrett (phil-barrett/grblHAL) — Teensy/STM32 board ecosystem
  reference for the keypad/MPG plugin interface


